{
  "about": "Public data the validation suites use, and SituCraft's example datasets: downloaded and checked by node validation/fetch.mjs into validation/cache/<name>/ (or $SITUCRAFT_DATA/<name>/); the program embeds this list (not the data) and downloads an example, with the same checks, when a user asks. tools are what the checks use, never part of SituCraft (axe-core, for the documentation's accessibility audit). Nothing here is stored in the repository or the SituCraft program. An archive is checked by its MD5 (as its publisher gives it) and SHA-256, extracted, every extracted file checked against the size and SHA-256 recorded here, and the archive deleted, so a bundle takes only its extracted size on disk.",
